 "paths": {
  "/api/v1/agent/projects": {
   "get": {
    "tags": [
     "agent-projects"
    ],
    "summary": "Get Agent Projects",
    "description": "``/agent/projects`` 列表：项目名 + id + 站点国家/地区。\n\nBLF-1022：每个 shop 返回 ``shop_name``（KJVS 首选启动参数）与\n``seller_identity``（Seller Central 账户切换器 alias 对照）；\n``shop_id`` 保持稳定主键（关闭参数/日志关联/fallback）。",
    "operationId": "get_agent_projects_api_v1_agent_projects_get",
    "parameters": [
     {
      "name": "status",
      "in": "query",
      "required": false,
      "schema": {
       "type": "string",
       "default": "active",
       "title": "Status"
      }
     },
     {
      "name": "name",
      "in": "query",
      "required": false,
      "schema": {
       "anyOf": [
        {
         "type": "string"
        },
        {
         "type": "null"
        }
       ],
       "title": "Name"
      }
     }
    ],
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "Successful Response",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "object",
         "additionalProperties": true,
         "title": "Response Get Agent Projects Api V1 Agent Projects Get"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "422": {
      "description": "Validation Error",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
        }
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "/api/v1/agent/complaint-center/batch": {
   "post": {
    "tags": [
     "agent-complaint-center"
    ],
    "summary": "Batch Upsert",
    "description": "W1 批量 upsert：一次事务收全家（run + shop_checks + complaints）。\n\n幂等：同一天 run_date 重复提交 → 更新原 run，不产生重复行。\n\nBLF-1022 身份门禁与事务一致性（整批拒绝，不落库）：\n* ``shop_checks`` 的 ``(project_id, country)`` 每批次最多一条；\n* ``check_status=ok`` 必须 ``identity_check.verified=true``，\n  否则 422 ``IDENTITY_CHECK_REQUIRED``；\n* ``identity_mismatch`` 配 ``verified=true`` → 422\n  ``IDENTITY_CHECK_CONTRADICTION``；\n* ``verified=true`` 但 alias/country 重算不匹配 → 422\n  ``IDENTITY_CHECK_INVALID``；\n* ``required=true`` 的店铺缺 ``expected_alias`` → 422\n  ``IDENTITY_EXPECTED_ALIAS_MISSING``；\n* complaints 只接受同一批次中 ``ok && verified=true`` 的\n  ``(project_id, country)``，否则整批 422（``IDENTITY_CHECK_REQUIRED``）；\n  ``identity_mismatch``/``login_page``/``launch_fail`` 的店铺不得产生\n  complaints；complaint 明细只用 ``project_id + country``。",
    "operationId": "batch_upsert_api_v1_agent_complaint_center_batch_post",
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "Successful Response",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "additionalProperties": true,
         "type": "object",
         "title": "Response Batch Upsert Api V1 Agent Complaint Center Batch Post"
        }
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
